Cell["\<\
The event {1, 3} is reached by light sent at arc length 2 and echoed back at \
4.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"6fafedde-ef66-4153-b83d-0ac89f74ddb7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"BondiRadarCoordinates", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"f3a6db83-0a31-40e0-bc5c-f057cc4d2304"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarTime\"\>", "\[Rule]", "3"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarDistance\"\>", "\[Rule]", "1"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"EmitArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", "2"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"ReturnArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", "4"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]= ",ExpressionUUID->"983d64b0-49ff-4901-9e2c-e3d469c15e7e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "At the light angle \[Pi]/3 the radar time is the same and the radar \
distance shrinks by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["cot",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", "\[CurlyPhi]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e2c0d3de-141b-4593-bf0b-812099212b59"],
 "."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"5f8ab5de-3a18-4166-9a14-3a12f2d9344c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"BondiRadarCoordinates", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "3"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"ab30cb35-3efb-45f5-bc4b-50cc9bf17f9d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarTime\"\>", "\[Rule]", "3"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarDistance\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    FractionBox["1", 
     SqrtBox["3"]]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"EmitArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"3", "-", 
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["3"]]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"ReturnArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"3", "+", 
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["3"]]}]}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"232101f7-d630-4c45-81e3-c3a9e22336c1"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

